\text{LHS} = \frac{\cos x}{\sin x} - \frac{\sin x}{\cos x} = \frac{\cos^2 x - \sin^2 x}{\sin x\cos x}
= \frac{\cos 2x}{\frac{1}{2}\sin 2x} = \frac{2\cos 2x}{\sin 2x}
= 2\cot 2x = \text{RHS}

